cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "ChinaHealth Open China Treatment Price Index 2026"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23684545"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - name: "ChinaHealth"
    website: "https://chinahealth.info"
url: "https://chinahealth.info/price-index"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JasonOA888/china-treatment-price-index"
abstract: >-
  Open dataset of published prices for 41 medical procedures in China that
  foreign patients commonly seek, across public, public international/VIP and
  private hospital tiers, with source URL, source type, publication date,
  check date (2026-10-27) and confidence for every record, plus citable US
  reference prices. Primary currency CNY; USD approximations at 1 USD = 6.6681
  CNY (2026-10-26).
keywords:
  - China
  - healthcare prices
  - medical tourism
  - price transparency
  - NHSA
  - open data
